<title>USA: AlliedSignal to buy Irish chemical firm.</title>
<headline>AlliedSignal to buy Irish chemical firm.</headline>
<dateline>MORRIS TOWNSHIP, N.J. 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>AlliedSignal Inc on Tuesday said it agreed to purchase Iropharm Ltd, a privately held Irish manufacturer of chemical products for the pharmaceutical industry.</p>
<p>The parties expect to finalize the transaction within 60 days, AlliedSignal said.  Terms of the agreement were not announced.</p>
